  masthead: "KENT GAZETES\u0130"
  issue: "Say\u0131 1842"
  price: "Fiyat\u0131 10 TL"
  specialEdition: "DEPREM \xD6ZEL BASKISI"
  editionFormat: "{0}. g\xFCn \xB7 Ak\u015Fam bask\u0131s\u0131"
  fillers:
  - "Kentte hissedilen deprem k\u0131y\u0131 \u015Feridinde ve eski \xE7ar\u015F\u0131da
    hasara yol a\xE7t\u0131. Ekipler sabaha kadar \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131."
  - "Uzmanlar zemin et\xFCd\xFC yap\u0131lmadan verilen izinlerin a\u011F\u0131r
    sonu\xE7lar do\u011Furabilece\u011Fini hat\u0131rlatt\u0131. Belediye meclisi
    ola\u011Fan\xFCst\xFC toplan\u0131yor; muhalefet hesap sorulmas\u0131n\u0131
    istedi."
  - "Liman yolu trafi\u011Fe kontroll\xFC olarak a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. Okullar hafta
    boyunca tatil edildi. K\u0131z\u0131lay kan ba\u011F\u0131\u015F\u0131 \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131nda
    bulundu; ba\u011F\u0131\u015F noktalar\u0131 sabah dokuzda a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor."
  - "Spor: Yerel tak\u0131m\u0131n hafta sonu ma\xE7\u0131 ertelendi. Borsa g\xFCne
    d\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015Fle ba\u015Flad\u0131. Hava: par\xE7al\u0131 bulutlu, gece
    so\u011Fuk."
  adTitle: "DEPREM \xC7ANTASI"
  adLine: "su \xB7 fener \xB7 d\xFCd\xFCk \xB7 ilk yard\u0131m"
  paperTexture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 51bd05b73a7e7a0489caf46a31c3fe8b, type: 3}
